    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that interacts with an external provider to list or select a voice for a target locale. I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will import the necessary module from the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with the Polly service. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860437721,
          "start": 1789860435469
        },
        "type": "text"
