    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize SSML with voice and prosody controls, I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary SDK and use the specific client class and model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860432569,
